 SG_ FrontRightDoor_Open_RHD : 37|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ DoorsUnlocked_Reference : 30|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown

BO_ 154 BLINK_INFO: 8 Mazda
 SG_ LeftIndicatorLamp_Reference : 18|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ RightIndicatorLamp_Reference : 19|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ WiperLow_Reference : 33|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown

