 SG_ HazardSwitch_Reference : 10|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ RightIndicatorSwitch_Reference : 12|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ LeftIndicatorSwitch_Reference : 13|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Unknown
 SG_ FrontWiper : 21|2@0+ (1,0) [0|3] "" Unknown

