BO_ 120 BRAKE_PRESSURE: 8 Mazda
 SG_ BrakePressureRaw : 24|9@0+ (1,0) [0|511] "raw" Unknown

BO_ 359 HVAC_DATA: 8 Mazda
 SG_ Possible_HVAC_TempDemandRaw : 47|4@0+ (1,0) [0|15] "raw" Unknown

BO_ 1056 CHECK_AND_TEMP: 8 Mazda
 SG_ Possible_CoolantTemp : 7|8@0+ (1,-40) [-40|215] "degC" Unknown
